{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-haiku-5-5", "id": "msg_011Ch23YHzcw2RGyWZBgtvw2", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "I'm not signing off. I found three problems, and the developer could not reproduce any of them from my steps, though I saw each one on screen more than once.\n\n**Reported (all three came back \"could not reproduce with the steps given\"):**\n\n1. **Album split after rename.** After renaming huge.jpg to huge_r.jpg, the Albums tab shows two tiles, both \"IrisSeed\" with \"1 items\". The IrisSeed album opens with only big.jpg. The Move/Copy dialog lists the two IrisSeed albums as well. This stayed the same after switching tabs, and it happened on two separate attempts.\n2. **Capture date not saved.** In Edit metadata & EXIF > Origin, both a typed value (2019-03-05 10:20) and a value from \"Set Current Time\" were empty when I reopened the editor after Save. The Details sheet never shows a capture-date row, only Added and Modified.\n3. **Viewer title stale after rename.** The viewer header reads \"1 of 2 · huge\" for huge_r.jpg. Before the rename it showed the full file name, e.g. \"2 of 2 · big.jpg\".\n\n**Checked and working:**\n- Byte formatting with power-of-two divisors: big.jpg shows \"1.4 MB\" and huge.jpg shows \"2.4 MB\" (before the rename), which matches 1,500,000 and 2,500,000 bytes.\n- Rename: Rename is disabled while the name is unchanged, Cancel leaves the name as it was, and a committed rename updates File name, Path and the filmstrip. Details still shows huge_r.jpg and 2.4 MB after rotation and navigation.\n- Move/Copy dialog order: with Alpha, IrisSeed, IrisSeed and Zulu present, the list is alphabetical.\n\n**Test data I created:** albums \"Zulu\" and \"Alpha\" each hold a copy of big.jpg, and the Media grid now shows big.jpg three times. The original photos were not moved or deleted.\n\nI did not get to test the capture date on a photo that already carries EXIF data, because I could not add one from the device."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1908, "cache_read_input_tokens": 116207, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 1908}, "output_tokens": 8, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "598cab50-3a6d-4b52-bf63-8c7ee342a23b", "uuid": "ae0ee4a3-de15-426a-95bd-d3a8410d27a3", "timestamp": "2026-11-14T02:38:19.502Z", "request_id": "req_011Ch23YHemkeEeUZMaELTES"}
